{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45711","headline":"怀二三朝友 · 贯休","name":"怀二三朝友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伤心复伤心，流光似飞电。\n有惠骊龙十斛珠，不如一见君子面。\n愁人复愁人，满眼皆埃尘。\n有惠黄金一万斤，不如一见於仁人。\n我昔读诗书，如今尽抛也。\n只记得田叔孟温舒，帝王满口呼长者。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}